9295547_3979684832323677_6127445064984455443_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SfcqAyvE5x0Q7kNvwFfpb2V&_nc_oc=AdpK7voQUf6aJAyoVzeq35k_TQ6BypjFhJOziXanhFQygnOP4jY1BeNvHISvUfQBE9o&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-fra3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af92PZtxW-UbbxLLkP40_UTly4wuWUlsVyU7gjqcfDSmZw&oe=6A32A8D4"}, "display_name": "Aria Spark", "keywords": ["AI", "DIY", "Passthrough", "Design", "Aria"], "long_description": "Aria Spark transforms your Meta Quest into a spatial design studio. Powered by AI and real-time depth mapping, it turns any room into a live canvas where you can visualize changes, test ideas, and make confident decisions \u2014 before you buy, build, or hire.\n\n*  **Material Swap:** See your kitchen with marble countertops, your living room with hardwood floors, or your bedroom with new wall colors \u2014 all rendered live in your actual space.\n\n*  **Room Makeover:** Describe your vision \u2014 \"mid-century modern living room\" or \"minimalist Scandinavian kitchen\" \u2014 and watch Aria Spark generate a complete redesign overlaid on your real room.\n\n*   **Before & After:** Capture and compare your current space against proposed changes. Share screenshots with your designer, contractor, or partner.\n\n*   **Virtual Staging:** Stage an empty listing with virtual furniture in minutes. Walk buyers through a fully furnished space without moving a single piece.\n\n*   **Renovation Planning:** Show buyers the potential of a fixer-upper with live material swaps and layout changes during the showing.", "short_description": "See It Before You Build It. Aria Spark transforms your Meta Quest into a spatial design studio. Powered by AI and real-time depth mapping, it turns any room into a live canvas where you can visualize changes, test ideas, and make confident decisions before you buy, build, or hire."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.ariaspark.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "